  "description": "The Lorax is an iconic defender of wild and natural spaces. The Lorax has also been our iconic drop-bar bike in the lineup since 2016.\n\nThe next generation of Esker backcountry exploration to bear the Lorax name is a go-anywhere, steel, dropbar mountain bike that can take you from your town trails to the Tour Divide and everywhere in between.\n\nThe Lorax is equipped with everything you would expect from an Esker: External cable routing, a threaded bottom bracket, and 44mm head tube.\n\nThe Lorax also has 22 attachment points for all of your adventure accessories. This includes top tube, rack, and fender mounts built into the frame.\n\n29\" wheels\n\nClearance up to a 2.6\" tire\n\nCustom Tubing - seamless, quadruple-butted, tapered, Drawn Over Mandrel, size-specific, ED Coated, 4130 Chromoly\n\nPortage Dropout - for adjustability, singlespeed and upgradeability.\n\nUDH Compatible",
